      "instance_name": "mirror_reflection_scene",
      "label": "woman viewing her reflection in a mirror",
      "description": "The scene depicts a woman standing in front of a mirror, which shows two contrasting portrayals of her: one side shows her with arms crossed and a defiant expression, while the other side shows her smiling and holding up a garment. The word 'haters' is superimposed above the mirror, indicating the theme of ignoring critics. The spatial arrangement places the woman centrally, with the mirror dividing her image into two emotional states.",
